WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.069 --> 00:00:04.290
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and so much just
happened in the Arrow Finale.

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:08.330
They resolved most of the important stuff,
definitely left us hanging on a few big things

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.179
and we got a pretty good idea for what’s
going on in Season 3.

00:00:11.179 --> 00:00:12.650
So here’s what I’m going to do.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:16.970
I’ll start with Top 5 moments, then do my
review and then talk about Season 3 theories.

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:19.550
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do Arrow videos every week.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.920
Now that The Flash is coming I’ll be doing
bonus videos for that too.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:24.920
Probably still on Wednesdays.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:28.460
Be sure to subscribe to get everything and
leave me suggestions for bonus vids.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:32.349
So careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
the episode yet, but here are my top 5 moments.

00:00:32.349 --> 00:00:34.660
Number 5 - Roy Gets His Suit

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:39.520
That speech Oliver gave him was the same speech
Barry Gave to Oliver back in episode 9 during

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.579
the Flash crossover.

00:00:40.579 --> 00:00:42.910
That’s when Barry gave Oliver his Green
mask.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:47.820
So Roy’s mirakuru crash and burn is going
to inform his character in season 3.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:49.800
And since Thea is gone he’s sticking around.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.780
You don’t get a hero shot like he did in
the tunnel and then just dump the character.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:58.019
Although there have been some live action
Young Justice rumors.

00:00:58.019 --> 00:01:00.110
I think the costume is great.

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:01.350
It’s basically a version of Stephen Amell’s
costume.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:03.489
He’ll probably be hoodie bound for most
of season 3.

00:01:03.489 --> 00:01:06.180
But it’s really the mask that makes it a
costume.

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:09.229
I think his bow and arrows are the same type
Oliver uses.

00:01:09.229 --> 00:01:11.890
They’re just going to have to order double
the supply from now on.

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:14.909
Number 4 - Thea goes with Merlyn

00:01:14.909 --> 00:01:17.090
I think we expected this a little.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:19.579
But I had no idea what was going to push her
over that ledge.

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:23.479
And it turned out to be the revelation that
Roy was also lying about his relationship

00:01:23.479 --> 00:01:24.479
with the Arrow.

00:01:24.479 --> 00:01:28.340
There’s a whole lot we can unpack in the
comments, but the big takeaways are that she’s

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:29.340
toughening up.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:34.649
Like she’s on the same character arc Sara
was on when she joined the League of Assassins.

00:01:34.649 --> 00:01:38.850
She’s the daughter Merlyn always wanted.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:42.860
He’ll probably help her become the Artemis
persona.

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:45.229
From a comics standpoint it makes the most
sense.

00:01:45.229 --> 00:01:51.079
I’ll talk about this more in my Season 3
theories, but she still doesn’t know who

00:01:51.079 --> 00:01:55.770
the Arrow is and now that she’s going to
turn into a stone cold killer.

00:01:55.770 --> 00:01:57.800
She and Merlyn could become the Season 3 antagonists.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:05.430
Is Merlyn going to tell her that Oliver is
the Arrow though?

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:08.320
I think they’ll leave that moment for Season
3.

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:11.370
So they’ll both be back.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:14.860
Number 3 - Amanda Waller Versus The Suicide
Squad

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:19.160
Because we got so much Amanda Waller this
season and given Lyla’s new baby and that

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:20.640
post-credits flashback scene.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.940
I think it’s safe to say we’re going to
see a lot of them next season.

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:27.061
The squad is probably going to evolve with
a new member or two and we’ll learn more

00:02:27.061 --> 00:02:28.870
about Oliver’s history with them.

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.890
Diggle and Oliver are both Fathers now and
that’s weird.

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:36.530
I thought season 3 would play into the sins
of the father theme even more just based on

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:39.020
Merlyn and Thea and Oliver and his son.

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:42.630
But adding Diggle to the baby list makes it
almost certain.

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:46.030
Which also pretty much guarantees we’ll
see Felicity’s father.

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:51.290
Waller and Oliver’s history is going to
be a lot of fun to dissect.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:56.130
It sounds like she either contracted him for
special missions or something to do with the

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.130
list.

00:02:57.130 --> 00:03:00.050
So Waller is going to be the island of season
3.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:09.610
Even though we still have a link to the island.

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:11.800
Number 2 - Slade To The Wrong Woman

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:16.390
This was a total fake out but I loved the
way they played it, start to finish.

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:19.310
I think twitter exploded when they had the
“I Love You Moment”.

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:22.850
It was all just clever editing and Felicity
was in on the fake out the whole time.

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:29.560
But boy did they take a long time to pay off
that secret camera plot from the promise episode.

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:34.670
And when they were on the beach Stephen Amell
reacted to Felicity in just the right way

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:38.810
as to let you think that he might not have
been acting when he said I love you.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:43.010
In my opinion he does love her, but not totally
in a romantic way.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:46.270
and my Number 1 moment - Slade Helps Oliver
Become A Hero

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:48.840
This all goes back to the heroes don’t kill
people thing.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:52.970
It’s just Oliver getting close to that Justice
League level of hero.

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:55.740
Slade taught him that he can defeat evil without
killing.

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.050
That there’s a better way.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:00.690
That’s why when they were jumping back and
forth between the flashbacks and their fight

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:01.690
at the end.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:05.290
Oliver ended the flashback by throwing the
serum away and trying to kill him.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.950
Consider that the low point.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:13.520
They never really addressed the Shado hallucinations
other than Slade said he hated Oliver before

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:16.340
those started.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:23.350
The big teaser now is that he’s tucked away
in Argus’ new supermax prison on the Island.

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:28.590
In case you didn’t catch the reference,
when Oliver said, there will be more.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:33.200
He meant they would fight more Deathstroke
level villains and stick them in the underground

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.200
prison too.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.010
People way worse than the Suicide Squad members.

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:39.120
I think that eventually each future season
will escalate the number of supervillains

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:42.330
until the series finale in season 7 or 8 or
whenever they end the show.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:46.590
Will be like Arkham Prison when all the supervillains
were let out at the same time.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.230
Like Oliver’s going to slowly fill that
Argus prison till it’s full.

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:52.690
Then some supervillain will come along and
free everyone and it will be Hell on Earth.

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:57.150
Prison Break Injustice Society Edition.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:59.840
But now it’s your turn, let me know what
your favorite moments were and whether or

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:03.040
not you think Thea is going to be a villain
next season?

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:10.700
I’ll say the funniest moment was probably
Felicity Versus Nyssa in the battle of introductions.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.060
Felicity Smoak.

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:14.070
MIT, Class of ‘09.

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:19.200
Overall the episode was a solid A. It did
a great job of capping off a season that kept

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:25.361
escalating the stakes to infinity each week
and at the same time setting up Season 3 in

00:05:25.361 --> 00:05:26.820
a really exciting way.

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:32.330
Don’t you feel like if you combined a few
scenes from the last 15 minutes or so it would

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.700
be a perfect Season 3 trailer.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:39.550
You have Thea and Merlyn’s new arc, Roy
as a fully realized Arsenal and Team Arrow

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:42.450
moving to a new location with babies.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:46.170
And Amanda Waller off to the side just staring
daggers at everyone.

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:49.840
The only things I wish they had spent more
time on were Slade and Oliver’s final moments,

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.520
not the prison scene, but Slade’s breakdown
and their dramatic moments.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:52.520
The fight was great.

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:53.520
Both the flashback fight and the current day
one.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:59.139
We got a peek into Slade’s mind during episode
18 when we learned about evil tinkerbell Shado.

00:05:59.139 --> 00:06:05.660
But they might be saving a lot of the cerebral
Slade moments for Season 3 and beyond.

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:10.180
I think it would be fun if it turned into
like a Blacklist thing, where Slade becomes

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:16.570
like James Spader and his daughter is an Argus
person.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:21.660
On to Laurel and Thea, those two characters
went through the biggest transformations this

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:22.660
season.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:26.550
Thea’s really just happened in the last
couple of episodes.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:31.050
As for that jacket, it was definitely the
most on-the-nose reference to the comics.

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:34.000
Especially Quentin’s response.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:38.420
I think it means that Laurel isn’t going
to be Black Canary for at least one more year.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:42.580
Think about how long it took Roy to become
Red Arrow.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:43.580
All Season.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.440
But Thea and Merlyn are really the thing I’m
most excited about.

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:49.740
I’m more excited about them than Oliver’s
baby.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:51.550
So let’s talk Season 3.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:55.669
I’m just going to blast through these really
quick and we can follow up in the comments.

00:06:55.669 --> 00:07:00.440
Starting with New Arrowcave, the foundry was
trashed, Thea doesn’t own it anymore and

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.520
she’s left town.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.110
So they’re not going back there.

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:07.380
Cut to that other site Oliver went to during
Moira’s funeral.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.450
Getting the company back.

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:10.919
I'm not expecting Oliver to be Mayor, but
I think there will be a new cast member that

00:07:10.919 --> 00:07:11.919
will help them get the company back.

00:07:11.919 --> 00:07:16.380
Or they'll do like in the comics where Oliver
creates a new company and then just buys back

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:17.780
Queen Industries.

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:19.230
New arrow cave new company.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:21.710
Seems like it fits.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:22.960
Thea as Artemis.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:27.540
She’ll probably have a season long arc where
she becomes a version of the Dark Archer.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:28.710
Like Father like Daughter.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.990
It’s possible that they could become the
season 3 villains, or at least antagonists

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:37.960
for Team Arrow.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.300
Flash Crossover.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.830
We saw the trailer during the episode.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.889
Stephen Amell was helping Barry train.

00:07:42.889 --> 00:07:48.370
Plan on him and Felicity being in Flash episode
1 and there to be at least one or two direct

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:49.370
crossovers.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:51.150
They will have a shared universe.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:56.310
Argus, The Suicide Squad and Amanda Waller
will all continue to interact with Team Arrow

00:07:56.310 --> 00:07:58.240
a couple times a season.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:02.400
Also, now that we have Lyla and Diggle’s
baby, it’s one more reason to throw to them

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:03.580
in a story.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:08.639
She’s Argus, so any episode Lyla’s in,
automatically becomes a back door suicide

00:08:08.639 --> 00:08:11.169
squad Amanda Waller episode.

00:08:11.169 --> 00:08:13.200
Which leads me to Flashbacks.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:17.340
Now that we know Oliver spent time with Amanda
Waller after he left the island, but before

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:19.010
he returned to Starling.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:22.050
All the flashback moments will pull from that
time period.

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:25.710
I’m thinking Oliver Argus Agent in China
type stuff.

00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:30.760
More opportunities for him to bump into new
villains in the past.

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:31.930
Baby Time.

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:34.340
The mother of Oliver’s child moved to Central
City.

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:38.710
We’ll probably learn more about them and
it will probably be part of a Flash Crossover.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:41.860
Also Diggle’s baby will probably get tied
up in some new plot too.

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.229
He’s not leaving the team.

00:08:43.229 --> 00:08:45.730
And Lyla isn’t quitting ARGUS.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:47.860
The League of Assassin’s and the Canary.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.670
Will cameo at least once.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:53.550
I’m hoping Team Arrow goes on a road trip
to Nanda Parbat.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:54.750
That would be sweet.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:58.940
That’s pretty much it, but if you think
I forgot anything, just write it in the comments

00:08:58.940 --> 00:08:59.940
below.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:04.940
In case you didn’t see it, I posted a breakdown
of the Flash trailer.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.730
and I’m posting my Q&amp;A video tomorrow.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.371
So ask me all your questions for either Arrow
or the Flash.

00:09:08.371 --> 00:09:09.371
Right now click here for that Flash Trailer
and Click here for the Q&amp;A.

00:09:09.371 --> 00:09:15.490
I’ll add the annotation as soon as I post
it.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:18.000
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:18.709
High Fives!

